Optional Concordia compatibility
--------------------------------

Silisocs does not vendor Concordia. The optional `silisocs[concordia]` extra
depends on `gdm-concordia`, which is distributed by Google DeepMind under the
Apache License 2.0.

Compatibility code under `silisocs.adapters.concordia` is intentionally
quarantined and exists only to interoperate with Concordia-shaped legacy agents
and game masters.
